{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><i>Is This a Platformer?</i> is a fast-paced action platformer that throws players into a hilariously absurd adventure filled with quirky characters, over-the-top obstacles, and laugh-out-loud moments at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Kenzu, a young Japanese video game otaku, suddenly pulled into a bizarre digital world. His mission? Rescue his brother from the clutches of a mysterious creature in a universe where nothing makes sense\u2014but everything is a challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/extras/giphy-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1742174881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Art Style:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Is This a Platformer?</i> brings its vibrant world to life with charming, retro-inspired pixel art. Think chunky, colorful pixels reminiscent of classic platformers but polished with modern touches. The result? A visual feast that blends nostalgia with fresh, creative flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And where else will you find a laughing sun or a bunch of screaming grapes? Oh, and don\u2019t forget the explosive <i>Kaboom!</i> effect\u2014because why not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/extras/giphy2-resize.gif?t=1742174881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re just Kenzu\u2014a regular guy with a killer jump and a mean punch. But in this world, <i>every</i> movement counts. Precision platforming, tight controls, and quick reflexes are your only allies as you leap, punch, and fight your way through absurd challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights? They're epic, over-the-top showdowns that mix intense platforming with wild humor and massive, unforgettable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got the skills to beat our toughest boss? Prove it. We dare you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/extras/giphy3-resize.gif?t=1742174881\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919480?t=1742174881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/b914d76fe89785d4d95791ee1fdfd1744f8c50c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742174881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/14ac4bf217790e24ba14fb4865ab2632383bf8f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742174881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919480/14ac4bf217790e24ba14fb4865ab2632383bf8f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742174881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><i>Is This a Platformer?</i> is a fast-paced action platformer that throws players into a hilariously absurd adventure filled with quirky characters, over-the-top obstacles, and laugh-out-loud moments at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Kenzu, a young Japanese video game otaku, suddenly pulled into a bizarre digital world. His mission? Rescue his brother from the clutches of a mysterious creature in a universe where nothing makes sense\u2014but everything is a challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s